    "## Stage 1: deterministic surface normalization\n",
    "\n",
    "This stage should resolve differences that do not require semantic judgment:\n",
    "case, Unicode width, underscores, hyphens, surrounding punctuation, compact\n",
    "spellings, and a small number of transparent token aliases.\n",
    "\n",
    "Numbers are preserved. `15k_sub_goal` and `20k_sub_goal` may share a broader\n",
    "family, but they are not interchangeable aliases."
   ]
